OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel's contract to be
OL,4,Acancelled this year, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe contract for a hotel in Falkirk to
OL,7,Fbe used as accommodation for asylum
OL,8,Fseekers will be cancelled this year,
OL,9,Fthe local Labour MP has said.
OL,11,FThe Cladhan was the site of several
OL,12,Fdemonstrations last summer involving
OL,13,Fpro and anti-immigration demonstrators.
OL,15,FThe protests, which have continued on a
OL,16,Fsmaller scale this year, were attended
OL,17,Fby hundreds of people on both sides and
OL,18,Fled to multiple arrests.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
