OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel's contract to be
OL,4,Acancelled this year, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the hotel, on the
OL,7,Ftown's Kemper Avenue, has not been used
OL,8,Ffor accommodating asylum seekers since
OL,9,FAugust and no more will be taken in.
